happened last night.

392
00:21:48.076 --> 00:21:50.384
I had no idea
that cup was spiked.

393
00:21:50.419 --> 00:21:52.045
Yeah. Oh, yeah.

394
00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:54.850
It was good.
Uh, that was... I got high.

395
00:21:54.885 --> 00:21:57.182
So you're
an experienced psychonaut.

396
00:21:58.757 --> 00:22:01.252
You know, like, um...

397
00:22:01.287 --> 00:22:03.661
