512
00:27:18.747 --> 00:27:20.010
(grunts)

513
00:27:24.346 --> 00:27:27.182
(whimpering)

514
00:27:32.354 --> 00:27:34.222
♪ Why's everybody... ♪

515
00:27:34.257 --> 00:27:38.193
That's my dad's shoe phone.

516
00:27:38.228 --> 00:27:39.931
He got it for free

517
00:27:39.966 --> 00:27:42.032
